   "title_basis": "Page 1 (Gazette of Pakistan, Extra., 18 November 1956, p.2068) prints 'MINISTRY OF COMMERCE ... ORDINANCE No. XXIII OF 1956' above the Ordinance; section 1(1) prints 'This Ordinance may be called the Cotton Ordinance, 1956.' The '(XV of 1956)' at the top of page 1 is the Jute Ordinance's own number, in the tail of that preceding instrument (set aside). Section 21(1) repeals the earlier Cotton Ordinance, 1956 (XVI of 1956)."
